11	 * {@link FiscalYear}), i.e. the owner registered in an earlier fiscal year than the current one.
12	 * Because a newly created owner's registration date is the current date, it shares the current
13	 * fiscal year, so a new owner never earns the tenure points. Derived purely from the owner's own
14	 * stored state ({@code namesakeCount} and {@code householdSize} are recorded at create time), so it
15	 * is seed-independent. Used by the owner mapper to expose {@code membershipPoints} on responses and,
